WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:05,990
Zhang Yi is sorry

2
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:09,830
Yesterday, under the torture of the severe cold, I lost control of my emotions and said a lot of things.

3
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,630
I shouldn't lose my temper with you

4
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:14,660
I'll figure it out after I calm down

5
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,920
I used to be too conceited and ignorant

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:21,020
I can't see clearly who is the one who treats me sincerely

7
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,090
In fact, I have always had a crush on you.

8
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:27,790
Please forgive me this time

9
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,670
How about we live a stable life together from now on?

10
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,830
You must be lonely if you live alone

11
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,670
I can go over and accompany you

12
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,990
Get through this long end together

13
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,990
Even if it takes a while, there is no need

14
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:40,710
There is no disturbance in my heart

15
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,900
I just think it's ridiculous
